oration, and ambition.</div></div></a></div></div></nav></div></div><div class=\"nav-menu-button\"><div class=\"tertiary-navbar-wrapper\"><a href=\"/test-ride\" class=\"secondary-button-gray tablet-hidden w-inline-block\"><div class=\"button-text-block\">Book Test Ride</div></a><div class=\"tertiary-navbar-cta\"><div class=\"navbar-cta-text-block\">Contact Roam</div></div></div></div></nav><div class=\"nav-menu-hamburger w-nav-button\"><div class=\"hamburger-wrapper\"><div class=\"hamburger-line-top\"></div><div class=\"hamburger-line-middle\"><div class=\"hamburger-line-middle-inner\"></div></div><div class=\"hamburger-line-bottom\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"newsletter-component\"><div class=\"component-padding\"><div class=\"newsletter-container\"><div class=\"component-vertical-padding\"><div class=\"newsletter-header-wrapper\"><div class=\"newsletters-header\"><div class=\"newsletter-header-button\"><a data-w-id=\"831c668e-9a66-a659-eb28-4994b3c3b064\" href=\"/press-releases\" class=\"header-button-link w-inline-block\"><div class=\"header-button-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M15.8332 10.0003H4.1665M4.1665 10.0003L9.99984 15.8337M4.1665 10.0003L9.99984 4.16699\" stroke=\"CurrentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.67\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div><div class=\"header-button-title\">View All Our Newsletters</div></a></div><div class=\"newsletter-titles\"><h1 class=\"primary-newsletter-title\">Roam Launches Africa’s First Roam Hub: A Multi Purpose Electric Motorcycle Charging Station</h1><div class=\"newsletter-edition-date\">Nairobi Kenya, 25 July 2024</div></div></div></div><div class=\"newsletter-image-wrapper\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd32268340e2_Newsletter%20Image%2000126-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd32268340e2_Newsletter%20Image%2000126-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd32268340e2_Newsletter%20Image%2000126-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd32268340e2_Newsletter%20Image%2000126.jpg 1200w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd32268340e2_Newsletter%20Image%2000126.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-header-image\"></div><div class=\"newsletter-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"newsletter-content\"><div class=\"rich-text-content w-richtext\"><ul role=\"list\"><li>Roam has today put into operation Africa’s first Roam Hub, an electric motorcycle charging station at 3 key sites all over Nairobi county with plans to add more locations to their network over the coming months.</li><li>The Roam Hub charging stations are equipped with fast chargers capable of charging the Roam Air, (the company’s electric motorcycle) in less than an hour. The stations are also powered partly by solar energy and are designed with an interoperability function that allows other electric vehicles from Roam’s partners to be serviced at these locations.</li><li>The charging stations are all-encompassing offering battery rental services, battery charging and after-sales services making the Roam Hub the ultimate solution for the variable needs of electric motorcycle riders.</li></ul></div><div class=\"captioned-figure\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834183_Newsletter%2520Image%252000127-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834183_Newsletter%20Image%2000127.jpg 800w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834183_Newsletter%20Image%2000127.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-image\"><div class=\"newsletter-caption-2\">A Roam Hub attendant taking the rider's identification details.</div></div><div class=\"rich-text-content w-richtext\"><p>Roam has today announced the launch of Africa’s first Roam Hub, a multi-purpose electric motorcycle charging station. Though it is still possible to charge the Roam Air at home, the Roam Hub acts as an ecosystem solution for drivers providing them with public access to battery charging and battery rental services as they run their day-to-day operations.</p><p>Designed with the versatile needs of electric vehicle users in mind, the Roam Hub is specially tailored to meet the demands of boda-boda operators, who are the mainstay of the motorcycle taxi industry in Kenya. </p></div><div class=\"captioned-figure\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834181_Newsletter%2520Image%252000128-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834181_Newsletter%20Image%2000128.jpg 800w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834181_Newsletter%20Image%2000128.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-image\"><div class=\"newsletter-caption-2\">The Roam Air rider dropping off their battery for charging at the Roam Hub.</div></div><div class=\"rich-text-content w-richtext\"><p>The stations are also equipped with spare parts and staffed with trained technicians who can provide maintenance and repair services as needed. In addition to these after-sales services, the Roam Hub sites also serve as public access points for technology and software updates on the Roam Air making them one-stop-shops for the different needs riders may have.</p></div><div class=\"captioned-figure\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834182_Newsletter%2520Image%252000129-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834182_Newsletter%20Image%2000129.jpg 800w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834182_Newsletter%20Image%2000129.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-image\"><div class=\"newsletter-caption-2\">The rider picks up their Roam Air battery once it is fully charged.</div></div><div class=\"rich-text-content w-richtext\"><p>This launch meets one of the company’s core goals of offering a holistic and hassle-free riding experience to its customers. The Roam Hub charging stations are strategically located at the heart of busy urban areas namely: Total Energies Lusaka Road (the flagship location), Waiyaki Way, and Ngong Road.</p><p>The roll-out of this dedicated charging network for electric motorcycle riders is an important step in Roam’s vision towards decarbonising Kenya’s boda-boda sector.</p></div><div class=\"captioned-figure\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834184_Newsletter%2520Image%252000130-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834184_Newsletter%20Image%2000130.jpg 800w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834184_Newsletter%20Image%2000130.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-image\"><div class=\"newsletter-caption-2\">The rider securing the fully charged battery onto the electric motorcycle's battery compartment.</div></div><blockquote class=\"newsletter-quote\"><em>At Roam, we believe that simplifying the charging experience is essential to electric motorcycle adoption and customer satisfaction. With these three initial service stations, we believe that the Roam Hub will play a key role in providing sustainable transportation solutions for the people of Kenya. We are confident that this hassle-free charging experience is what will eventually turn the boda boda industry electric.<br></em><span class=\"newsletter-caption\">Habib Lukaya, Former Energy &amp; Charging Product Manager.</span></blockquote><div class=\"captioned-figure\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834185_Newsletter%2520Image%252000131-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834185_Newsletter%20Image%2000131.jpg 800w\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68491dec0c89cd3226833f4f/68491dec0c89cd3226834185_Newsletter%20Image%2000131.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"newsletter-image\"><div class=\"newsletter-caption-2\">An aerial view of the Roam Hub, Africa's first electric motorcycle service station.</div></div><blockquote class=\"newsletter-quote\"><em>This is a landmark moment. The launch of the Roam Hub demonstrates our ability to advance our sustainability and electrification goals through a versatile set of charging solutions and technology offerings. With our industry-leading electrification ambitions, we can change the future of electric motorcycles in Kenya.<br></em><span class=\"newsletter-caption\">Romain Petiteau, Head of Energy &amp; Charging.</span></blockquote><div class=\"rich-text-content w-richtext\"><p><strong>About Roam</strong></p><p>Roam is a technology company that develops, designs and deploys electric vehicles tailored for the African continent, leading the transition to sustainable transport. Founded in 2017, it became the first company to deliver locally produced electric motorcycles and buses. Roam is today the leading provider of electric vehicles in Africa and was recently a finalist in Prince Williams, Earth Shot Prize.</p><p><strong>Download:</strong> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16Q4FsWcvgqFGBoWrWKilKZvRwVbu0YBT?usp=sharing\">High-Quality Images</a><strong><br>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.roammotors.com/\">https://www.roam-electric.com/</a><strong><br>Contact: </strong><a href=\"mailto:albin.wilson@opibus.se\">albin.wilson@roam-electric.com</a></p></div></div><div class=\"newsletter-subscription-cta\"><div class=\"global-heading\">Stay Informed on the Future of Electric Mobility</div><div class=\"paragraph-text-2\">Get the latest news, product launches, innovation highlights, and behind the scenes updates from Roam delivered straight to your inbox. Be the first to know how we are shaping sustainable transport across the continent.</div><div class=\"global-subscription-form w-form\"><form id=\"email-form\" name=\"email-form\" data-name=\"Email Form\" method=\"get\" class=\"subscription-form-content\" data-wf-page-id=\"68491dec0c89cd3226834027\" data-wf-element-id=\"831c668e-9a66-a659-eb28-4994b3c3b09b\"><div class=\"subscription-form-wrapper\"><input class=\"form-email-input-2 w-input\" maxlength=\"256\" name=\"Subscription-2\" data-name=\"Subscription 2\" placeholder=\"Enter your email adress\" type=\"email\" id=\"Subscription-2\" required=\"\"><input type=\"submit\" data-wait=\"Please wait...\" class=\"subscription-button-2 mini-button w-button\" value=\"Subscribe to Our Newsletters\"></div></form><div class=\"w-form-done\"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class=\"w-form-fail\"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"newsletter-spotlight\"><div class=\"component-padding\"><div class=\"newsletter-container\"><div class=\"component-vertical-padding\"><div class=\"newsletter-spotlight-title\"><div class=\"newsletters-header align-center\"><h2 class=\"primary-header-title\">More News &amp; Press</h2></div></div><div class=\"newsletter-spotlight-grid\"><div class=\"spotlight-grid-wrapper\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid spotlight-grid-content\"><div class=\"grid-content-wrapper\"><a data-w-id=\"79bc705f-1915-b8ab-bb2b-90a3e83a9259\" href=\"#\" class=\"grid-content-image-link w-inline-block\"><div class=\"image-link-wrapp